    "Reason : 1 - The proposed single storey rear extension by virtue of its size and scale would harm the living conditions of the attached property through an increased sense of enclosure, loss of light and loss of outlook. Thus making it contrary to adopted Local Plan Policies CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) and the intent of the Hounslow Character, Sustainability and Design Codes SPD."
